<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Palmco share placement approved.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Palmco share placement approved.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palmco Holdings Bhd Bhd said on Monday that the Securities Commission has approved its proposed private placement of up to 15 million new ordinary shares of 1.00 ringgit each.</p>
<p>The company is involved in producing palm kernel oil and pellets and other palm products.</p>
<p>Palmco previously said the proposal would boost its share capital to 174.17 million ringgit, and enable it to finance the expansion of its operations.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
